Z||000007||Phaeton||06-10-2000||11:30 PM||||Saw the pics in the Mall, those particular lights can be bolted up using the turn signal mounts on the front bar.  I know its too late for yours, but for others, the hard mount makes them less stealable.<BR>Oh yeah, add an extra two hours to the install time to get fascia off and on.<P>Installing an old ford spark coil and proximity trigger adds another hour and a half, but insures each perp only tries once to remove accessories from your Fiero.||||reg||12
